SUMMARY:Stephen Schwartz: A Benefit Concert for Prima
DESCRIPTION:📍 Rock Lititz – 100 Rock Lititz Blvd\, Lititz\, PA Broadwa
 y legend Stephen Schwartz — the Grammy\, Oscar\, and Tony Award–winnin
 g composer of Wicked\, Pippin\, Godspell\, Pocahontas\, The Hunchback of N
 otre Dame\, The Prince of Egypt\, and Enchanted — comes to Lancaster Cou
 nty for a once-in-a-lifetime benefit event at Rock Lititz. At the piano\, 
 Schwartz will perform his most beloved works and share stories from a care
 er that has shaped Broadway and Disney alike. He is joined by powerhouse P
 rima performers\, filling the space with music\, heart\, and meaning. But 
 this evening is about more than a concert. It’s a moment to fuel the nex
 t great cultural movement in Lancaster. Just as Rock Lititz redefined what
 ’s possible in live music\, Prima is redefining what’s possible in liv
 e theatre — making Lancaster the launchpad for bold\, original works tha
 t premiere locally before reaching national stages. Your participation hel
 ps fuel cultural vitality\, community vibrancy\, and economic growth for o
 ur region. WHY THIS NIGHT MATTERS Rock Lititz showed that the world’s bi
 ggest tours can start here. Prima is proving that tomorrow’s great theat
 rical works can\, too. This benefit event fuels Prima’s mission to invig
 orate lives through fresh theatrical experiences — performances that are
  intimate\, joyful\, and deeply human. Your support helps: Launch bold new
  theatrical works born in Lancaster. Bring national artists and creative v
 oices to our community. Give audiences world-class experiences first\, rig
 ht here at home. This night ensures Lancaster isn’t just consuming cultu
 re — it’s creating it. Come Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Art
